  "assessment": [
    "The18 bundled IDs cover the exact Phase3 Markdown-playbook catalogue; optional TypeScript helpers are honestly absent. All18 workflows and verification sections were read.",
    "Catalog/Markdown are compile-time engine-owned constants. Exact-ID lookup and deny_unknown_fields reject project paths, override/source fields and helper execution. Outputs are finite and covered by the bounds test; project memory cannot replace guidance.",
    "Conversation/tool integration adds only guidance consultation and read-only dispatch. Mutation and provider/project fences stay unchanged. Following guidance still reaches normal doc_patch/script_write/asset_import revision/source guards, shared command history and approval modes. The new mocked-provider denial control observes no transaction/revision change.",
    "Concrete NativeBehavior/NativeContext, persistence v1, chunks/strides, physics/navigation, timers, input.ui, HUD/structural commands, localization and string-table command names match current SDK/host source. Spawn/host/input/profiler/save/export omissions are stated as capability refusals, not fabricated APIs.",
    "Verification language preserves native runtime vs authoring separation, quotas/expired views, actual contact corrections, bounded data recordings and human translation review. Common guidance explicitly honors capture restrictions."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Reviewer ran no Rust builds/tests, engine/player, provider request, GPU/window, CUA or capture; only source/Git/metadata and raw-log identity checks.",
    "Root logs independently rehashed:118 CPU tests including3 new skill controls, strict all-target Clippy, fmt and conventions. These are retained root results, not reviewer execution.",
    "No live-provider skill-following/eval quality, implemented18mechanic scenarios, GUI integration, appearance, performance, red-team or Phase3 gate approval established. Profiler/native-Wasm compilation/export/full session-save and some runtime controls remain contingent on real advertised host capabilities.",
    "No execution/tool privilege is granted by reading a playbook; no skill_run/helper execution endpoint added."
